{"ID":"20240205153643-0r5zj7z","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153643-0r5zj7z","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153643-0r5zj7z\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506111038-ahmazts\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240614091347-r1j3zui\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:3872,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240614091726-ae4q1f9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:9,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:9\u0026#125;","title":"353杏核仁（杏仁）","type":"doc","updated":"20240828095925"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240506111038-ahmazts","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240506111038-ahmazts","updated":"20240506111043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"苦杏仁"}]},{"ID":"20240206100738-up84efo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206100738-up84efo","updated":"20240206100746"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产辽宁、内蒙古、河北、山东等地。\n【性状】\t苦杏仁：呈扁心形，长11.9cm，宽0.81.5cm，厚0.50.8cm。表面黄棕 色至深棕色，一端尖，另端钝圆，肥厚，左右不对称。尖端一侧有短线形种脐，圆端合点处向上具多数深棕色的脉纹。种皮薄，子叶2，乳白色，富油性。无臭，味苦。甜杏仁：干燥种子，呈扁心脏形，长1.62.1cm，宽1.2"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.6cm，顶端尖，基部圆，左右对称，种脊明显，种皮较苦杏仁为厚，淡黄棕色，自合点处分散出许多深棕色脉纹，形成纵向凹纹。断面白色。子叶接合面常见空隙。气微，味微甜。\n【品质】\t苦杏仁以颗粒均匀、饱满、完整、味苦者为佳。\n\t\t甜杏仁以颗粒均匀而大、饱满肥厚、不发油者为佳。\n【性味】\t苦杏仁：味苦，微温。\n甜杏仁：味甘、性平。\n【功效】\t降气止咳平喘，润肠通便。用于咳嗽气喘，胸满痰多，血虚津枯，肠燥便秘。\n【注解】\t“鼓肚子”：指苦杏仁呈扁心形，顶端略尖，基部左右不对称，中部膨大明显如肚子鼓出。"}]},{"ID":"20240206100739-qpb7mw7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206100739-qpb7mw7","updated":"20240206100739"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206100739-v34ra0d.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205164243-va3p3cb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205164243-va3p3cb","updated":"20240205164243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"苦杏仁"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/苦杏仁-20240205164243-5902k8x.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240703170433-jyb1r2n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240703170433-jyb1r2n","updated":"20240828095643"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 412px;","style":"width: 402px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"杏子2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/杏子2-20240703171046-bcjpst4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 402px;\" parent-style=\"width: 412px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 544px;","style":"width: 534px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"杏子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/杏子-20240703170951-6uyyag8.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 534px;\" parent-style=\"width: 544px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240703171205-zg5ngvc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240703171205-zg5ngvc","updated":"20240828095645"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 447px;","style":"width: 437px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240703171205-fy5l5d2.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 437px;\" parent-style=\"width: 447px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 624px;","style":"width: 614px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"杏子3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/杏子3-20240703171246-v15zhuu.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 614px;\" parent-style=\"width: 624px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240703171705-jnzh4p3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240703171705-jnzh4p3","updated":"20240828095649"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 740px;","style":"width: 730px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"杏子6"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/杏子6-20240703171705-8g4fx5j.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 730px;\" parent-style=\"width: 740px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 330px;","style":"width: 320px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"杏子8"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/杏子8-20240703171853-7sx636d.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 320px;\" parent-style=\"width: 330px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240703171351-f